== S2d: which feedback creates the hysteresis? bistable band in beta for four variants
  neither (pure Prop 1.5)         : monostable everywhere; psi* < 0.5 from beta ~ 0.705
  self-confirmation only k=0.4    : monostable everywhere; psi* < 0.5 from beta ~ 0.605
  performativity only ab/d=0.4    : monostable everywhere; psi* < 0.5 from beta ~ 0.8
  both                            : bistable beta in [0.650, 0.750]
